    "Small: favourite team today. Medium: saved matches in progress. Large: today's saved fixtures, using your league and favourite filters. Lock Screen: favourite score. Widgets read local cache and never request the network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small: favourite team today. Medium: saved matches in progress. Large: today's saved fixtures, using your league and favourite filters. Lock Screen: favourite score. Widgets read local cache and never request the network."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pequeno: favorito hoje. Médio: jogos salvos em andamento. Grande: jogos salvos de hoje com seus filtros de liga e favoritos. Tela bloqueada: placar favorito. Os widgets usam cache local, sem acessar a rede."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein: Favorit heute. Mittel: laufende gespeicherte Spiele. Groß: heutige Spiele mit deinen Liga- und Favoritenfiltern. Sperrbildschirm: Favoritenspielstand. Widgets lesen nur den lokalen Cache, ohne Netzabrufe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Petit : favori du jour. Moyen : matchs enregistrés en cours. Grand : matchs du jour avec vos filtres de ligues et favoris. Écran verrouillé : score favori. Les widgets lisent le cache local sans réseau."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pequeño: favorito hoy. Mediano: partidos guardados en curso. Grande: partidos de hoy con tus filtros de liga y favoritos. Pantalla bloqueada: resultado favorito. Los widgets leen la caché local sin red."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Piccolo: preferito oggi. Medio: partite salvate in corso. Grande: partite di oggi con filtri per campionato e preferiti. Schermata di blocco: risultato preferito. I widget leggono la cache locale senza rete."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعرض الأداة الصغيرة فريقك المفضل اليوم، والمتوسطة المباريات الجارية المحفوظة، والكبيرة جدول اليوم بحسب فلاترك. تعرض شاشة القفل نتيجة فريقك. تقرأ الأدوات بيانات الجهاز."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小型小工具顯示今日收藏球隊，中型顯示已儲存的進行中賽事，大型則依篩選條件顯示今日賽程。鎖定畫面顯示收藏比分。小工具讀取本機快取。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small: favourite team today. Medium: saved matches in progress. Large: today's saved fixtures, using your league and favourite filters. Lock Screen: favourite score. Widgets read local cache and never request the network."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small: favorite team today. Medium: saved matches in progress. Large: today's saved fixtures, using your league and favorite filters. Lock Screen: favorite score. Widgets read local cache and never request the network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Match Center from the Home Screen widget gallery. Change the league and favourite filters on Matchday to update the large widget.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Match Center from the Home Screen widget gallery. Change the league and favourite filters on Matchday to update the large widget."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adicione Match Center pela galeria de widgets. Altere os filtros de liga e favoritos no Dia de jogo para atualizar o widget grande."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge Match Center aus der Widget-Galerie hinzu. Ändere Liga- und Favoritenfilter am Spieltag, um das große Widget zu aktualisieren."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoutez Match Center depuis la galerie de widgets. Modifiez les filtres de ligues et favoris dans Jour de match pour le grand widget."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Añade Match Center desde la galería de widgets. Cambia los filtros de liga y favoritos en Día de partido para actualizar el widget grande."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aggiungi Match Center dalla galleria widget. Cambia i filtri in Giornata per aggiornare il widget grande."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أضف Match Center من معرض أدوات الشاشة الرئيسية. غيّر فلاتر الدوري والمفضلة في يوم المباراة لتحديث الأداة الكبيرة."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從主畫面的小工具資料庫加入 Match Center。在比賽日調整聯賽與收藏篩選條件，即可更新大型小工具。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Match Center from the Home Screen widget gallery. Change the league and favourite filters on Matchday to update the large widget."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Match Center from the Home Screen widget gallery. Change the league and favorite filters on Matchday to update the large widget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
